The 24 hours to {{ with query "time()" }}{{ . | first | value | humanizeTimestamp }}{{ end }}.

SERVICE
  Availability          {{ template "ind" "availability" }} of requests without a server error (SLO 99.5%)
  Within 300 ms         {{ template "ind" "latency_within_slo" }} of table and chart requests (SLO 95%), p95 {{ template "ind" "latency_p95" }}
  Requests              {{ template "ind" "requests" }}, peak {{ template "ind" "peak_rate" }} (15-minute average)
  Server errors         {{ template "ind" "errors_5xx" }} at the api{{ if eq "__INGRESS__" "true" }}, {{ template "ind" "ingress_5xx" }} at the ingress{{ end }}

ACTIVITY
